  "summary": "Depot-recovered scout frame. Fast, blind-spot small, and made of promises.",
  "lore": "The VES hulls came out of the Karst Reach depot stacked four deep, which is how everyone knows the Compact considered them expendable. Sarn rebuilds them on a stretched leg assembly that trades every gram of plate for stride length. A Vesper does not fight; it finds, it counts, and it is somewhere else before the counting is noticed. Pilots who treat it as a light brawler are a recognised category in the Barrow Reach mortality tables.",
